WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.569
-Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show"!

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:05.438
Thank you very much, everybody.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.140
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.876
Well, guys, it was another
big day in Washington,

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:12.011
as House Democrats
formally introduced

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:15.047
the resolution to impeach
President Trump.

00:00:15.047 --> 00:00:17.584
And if you're watching,
no, this is not a repeat.

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:18.718
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:21.254
Yep, Trump is being
impeached again.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:24.190
Right now, everyone in America
is having déjà coup.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.958
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:27.227
This morning, Trump was charged

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:29.328
with "incitement
of insurrection."

00:00:29.328 --> 00:00:30.730
You know you messed up

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.733 line:0%
when you're charged with the
title of a '90s Star Trek movie.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.935 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:37.103
Seriously, it's never good

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:40.339
when your crowds rise
to the level of Klingon.

00:00:40.339 --> 00:00:42.976
It's looking like
one more impeachment for Trump.

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:45.545
Trump gets impeached the way
most people get vaccinated --

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:48.047
in two doses.

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:51.484
Some people say impeaching Trump
will divide the country.

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:55.054
Really? How much more divided
can the country get?

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:56.356
We're currently in a state

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:59.191
of Monopoly game
after Thanksgiving.

00:00:59.191 --> 00:01:01.861
That's where we are.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.930
Meanwhile, some of Trump's
most loyal defenders are saying

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:07.766
we shouldn't kick him
while he's down.

00:01:07.766 --> 00:01:08.968
Even "The Karate Kid" is going,

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:11.904
"Eh, this one time
feels okay, I think.

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:14.274
Sweep the leg, sweep the leg."

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:16.742
Well, if you think Trump's upset
about getting impeached,

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:19.445
imagine how he felt the other
day when Twitter announced

00:01:19.445 --> 00:01:22.214
that they're permanently
suspending his account.

00:01:22.214 --> 00:01:24.417
A lifetime ban.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:27.353
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:30.389 --> 00:01:31.724
A lifetime ban.

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:34.260
Trump's basically the Pete Rose
of social media.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.562
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:39.032
Right now, Trump's phone
is stuffed into a pile of rice

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:40.934
after being drenched with tears.

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:41.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:43.302
The good news is

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:45.472
now Twitter can go back
to what it used to be for --

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:48.541
judging celebrities
at award shows.

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:52.445
In addition to Twitter, Trump
has been banned or restricted

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:55.849
from Apple, Facebook,
Instagram, Snapchat,

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:58.184
Google, Amazon,
Pinterest, TikTok...

00:01:58.184 --> 00:01:59.619
[ Inhales deeply ]

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:03.189 line:0%
...YouTube, Reddit, Twitch,
Stripe, Discord, and Shopify.

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:06.192
-Aw.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:07.359
-Trump started this year

00:02:07.359 --> 00:02:08.895
thinking he should
be on Mount Rushmore.

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:11.664
Now can't even get on Instagram.

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:12.932
Seriously, in one weekend,

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:15.602
Trump's phone became
a $2,000 flashlight.

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:18.171
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:20.306
[ Applause ]

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:26.445
Yep, now Trump can't tweet,
snap, post, or stream.

00:02:26.445 --> 00:02:27.680
It's gotten so bad,

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.216
he can't even sell
embroidered pillows on Etsy.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:32.117
-Aw.
-Hmm.

00:02:32.117 --> 00:02:33.719
-Of course now we're going
to have to settle

00:02:33.719 --> 00:02:36.089
with him holding
50 press conferences a day

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:38.958
and yelling 280 characters
at a time.

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:42.094
Ah, it's 2:00 a.m. Time
for another press conference.

00:02:42.094 --> 00:02:45.064
Things have gotten so bad
for Trump that PGA announced

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:48.734
that they will no longer
hold the 2022 PGA Championship

00:02:48.734 --> 00:02:52.338
at Trump National Golf Club
in Bedminster, New Jersey.

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:55.508
[ Applause ]

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:57.844
No more Twitter, no more PGA.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.479
If Diet Coke comes out
against Trump,

00:02:59.479 --> 00:03:01.180
he's going to lose his mind.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.082
Again.

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:05.551
Let's change gears here.
Oh, this was fun.

00:03:05.551 --> 00:03:07.519
Yesterday, Nickelodeon
aired its first-ever

00:03:07.519 --> 00:03:10.623
kid-friendly broadcast
of an NFL playoff game.

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:11.924 line:0%
Check out what it looked like.

00:03:11.924 --> 00:03:14.693 line:0%
-Now plunging forward.
End zone and touchdown.

00:03:14.693 --> 00:03:17.262 line:0%
-Hey, there's the slime!

00:03:17.262 --> 00:03:19.265 line:0%
[ Imitating air horn ]

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:22.035 line:0%
-And now Wil Lutz will come on
for the extra point.

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:26.406 line:0%
And he kicks it
right through Spongebob.

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:29.275
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.275 --> 00:03:31.444
-Yeah. That actually
looked normal to me.

00:03:31.444 --> 00:03:32.845
Then again, I watch every game

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:34.881
after dropping
an insane amount of acid.

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:36.949
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.949 --> 00:03:39.285
"Uh, that was right through
Spongebob there.

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:40.920
Congratulations."

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.255
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:43.789
It was great. The slime cannons?

00:03:43.789 --> 00:03:45.424
-Yeah.
-It was awesome.

00:03:45.424 --> 00:03:47.327
A lot of people enjoyed
seeing the game like this.

00:03:47.327 --> 00:03:48.928
I mean, it was way better
than the time

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:51.197
they had the Rugrats
host a UFC fight.

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:52.665
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:55.401
That just didn't work.
That just didn't work.

00:03:55.401 --> 00:03:57.470 line:0%
Some entertainment news --
HBO announced

00:03:57.470 --> 00:04:00.273 line:0%
that they are rebooting
"Sex and the City."

00:04:00.273 --> 00:04:01.674 line:0%
Yeah.

00:04:01.674 --> 00:04:03.843
[ Applause ]

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:05.644
Even crazier, there's also
going to be a version

00:04:05.644 --> 00:04:07.280
that airs on Nickelodeon.

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:10.482
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.482 --> 00:04:11.817
Yep, everyone is back,

00:04:11.817 --> 00:04:15.288
except Kim Cattrall won't
reprise her role as Samantha.

00:04:15.288 --> 00:04:18.257
It's like "The Avengers"
rebooting, but Thor is like,

00:04:18.257 --> 00:04:20.393
"You won't be seeing
this hammer."

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:23.162
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:25.030
[ Cymbals tapping ]

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:27.499
Yep, 17 years
after the final episode,

00:04:27.499 --> 00:04:29.568
"Sex and the City" coming back.

00:04:29.568 --> 00:04:31.170
They already released
an episode,

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:32.305
and the first 20 minutes

00:04:32.305 --> 00:04:35.007
is Mr. Big waiting
for his pill to kick in.

00:04:35.007 --> 00:04:40.179
[ Laughter, groaning ]

00:04:40.179 --> 00:04:42.148
And finally I saw
that Dwayne "The Rock" Johnson

00:04:42.148 --> 00:04:45.651
is launching a healthy
energy drink called ZOA.

00:04:45.651 --> 00:04:47.086
You can tell the drink is good.

00:04:47.086 --> 00:04:49.989
Nancy Pelosi just chugged one,
crushed the can on her forehead,

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:52.858
and said,
"Let's impeach this Jimbroni."

00:04:52.858 --> 00:04:54.027
Hi, everyone!
Thank you very much.

00:04:54.027 --> 00:04:56.061
it is Monday.
We're excited to be back,

00:04:56.061 --> 00:04:58.364
and we got a fantastic week
of shows ahead.

00:04:58.364 --> 00:05:00.700
Nicole Kidman will be here!

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:03.402
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:03.402 --> 00:05:05.872
Amazing.
Did you see "The Undoing"?

00:05:05.872 --> 00:05:08.341
-Yeah, I did.
-She crushed it, man.

00:05:08.341 --> 00:05:11.844
Anthony Mackie will be here.
Oh, I love Anthony Mackie.

00:05:11.844 --> 00:05:17.316
Plus, Anne Hathaway,
Angela Bassett, Lilly Singh.

00:05:17.316 --> 00:05:18.618
Oh, stay up late tonight.

00:05:18.618 --> 00:05:21.687
Lilly Singh is premiering
tonight after Seth.

00:05:21.687 --> 00:05:23.121
So it goes me, Seth, then Lilly.

00:05:23.121 --> 00:05:24.456
But it premieres tonight.

00:05:24.456 --> 00:05:25.824
We love you, Lilly Singh.

00:05:25.824 --> 00:05:28.027
Check out Lilly tonight.

00:05:28.027 --> 00:05:29.795
But first, we have a great show
for you tonight.

00:05:29.795 --> 00:05:33.999
She stars in the movie
"On the Rocks" on Apple TV Plus.

00:05:33.999 --> 00:05:36.102
Rashida Jones is here.

00:05:36.102 --> 00:05:38.237
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:38.237 --> 00:05:41.340
Plus, from the film
"The King of Staten Island"

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:45.010
and "The Mandalorian,"
Bill Burr is here.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.213
God.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:47.213 --> 00:05:49.982
That dude is next-level funny.

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:52.151
-Yeah, man.
-He's on a different world, man.

00:05:52.151 --> 00:05:54.853
He's just -- Gosh,
I just love that guy so much.

00:05:54.853 --> 00:05:58.591
And we got great music
from Old Dominion!

